{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119625","id":3722236080,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7d3NCw","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119625","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119625.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119625.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119625","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119625/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119625/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119625/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/cfcec5cccade634936ce7272fd97b01508cdd61e","number":119625,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"TextServerFB: Fix zero-width space detection and rendering","user":{"login":"barthy-koeln","id":10552683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTUyNjgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10552683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/barthy-koeln","html_url":"https://github.com/barthy-koeln","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barthy-koeln/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barthy-koeln/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barthy-koeln/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barthy-koeln/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barthy-koeln/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barthy-koeln/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barthy-koeln/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barthy-koeln/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barthy-koeln/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The fallback text server renders visible spaces in place of zero-width spaces at the end of labels:\r\n\r\n* It lacks detection for `0x2060` (⁠WORD JOINER) and `0xFEFF` (ZERO WIDTH NO-BREAK SPACE)\r\n* It did not respect \"preserve_control\" when detecting these\r\n* It does not hard-reset \"advance\" after falling back to a regular space for calculations\r\n* It does not hard-reset the glyph index to 0 to not render the glyph at all\r\n\r\nThis fixes both visible spaces if the font has it, and hex-box glyph fallbacks if the font has no `0x0020` space.\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #119623\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n* I copied the bugfix of #111014 as I understood it\r\n* I tested manually as described in the reproducer in #119623\r\n* I did use Claude to help me navigate/understand the change and be ready to \"defend it\"\r\n* Any issue, pr, comment I post is written manually with my human brain\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":